[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7680.87, "timestamp": "02:08:00", "text": "但是，如果我兴致勃勃地想去冒险"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7686.79, "timestamp": "02:08:06", "text": "探索，那就进入探索模式，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7689.51, "timestamp": "02:08:09", "text": "做另一件事。 是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7701.109, "timestamp": "02:08:21", "text": "你想知道我跟他说过什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7703.03, "timestamp": "02:08:23", "text": "他问：“你有空吗？” 我问：“你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7705.83, "timestamp": "02:08:25", "text": "有空吗？” 他说：“是啊，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7708.069, "timestamp": "02:08:28", "text": "脖子有点僵硬。现在就加入慢跑直播吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7710.629, "timestamp": "02:08:30", "text": "。” 他说：“好的。” 我会说：“请"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7714.39, "timestamp": "02:08:34", "text": "立即加入通话。我们现在需要你。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7717.75, "timestamp": "02:08:37", "text": "我问：“发生了什么事？” 我说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7720.79, "timestamp": "02:08:40", "text": "“去做吧。给我讲几句话。” 我刚才说了句"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7723.43, "timestamp": "02:08:43", "text": "特别搞笑的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7727.589, "timestamp": "02:08:47", "text": "兄弟，我们等着你呢。  D 全"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7729.669, "timestamp": "02:08:49", "text": "大写。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7731.48, "timestamp": "02:08:51", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7734.31, "timestamp": "02:08:54", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7736.31, "timestamp": "02:08:56", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7738.87, "timestamp": "02:08:58", "text": "如果这都不算有趣，那什么才算有趣呢？"}]